  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Int, +1 Dex Speed: 30 feet. Skill Proficiencies: Ninshou, Sleight of Hand\nTool Proficiencies: Hacker Kit, Security Kit  Extra Language: Machine-Speak. You can translate electronic signals transmitted between machines so long as you are in physical contact with either the sending or receiving machine.  Passive Affinity: You have the Lightning Release Affinity.\nData Release Techniques: The Genwa Clan has access to a separate list of jutsu unique to their clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the normal jutsu list(s).\nHijutsu Flexibility: Genwa Clan Hijutsu can use either Intelligence or Wisdom as its casting ability score.\nRadio Tower: You always count as possessing a Radio Link communication tool which doesn’t require a device and instead you can hear and respond to radio transmissions with no tools or equipment. Also, radio-based communication will always work as you function as a radio tower for tools and equipment within 1 mile of you, even if no radio transmissions is possible. Signals originating from you cannot be intercepted or traced using ninja tools.",
